VerifierAdapter\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"STATEMENT_SCHEMA_VERSION()\":{\"notice\":\"The statement schema version committed by the SP1 guest.\"},\"extractStatementRoot(bytes)\":{\"notice\":\"Extract only the statement root from public values (no proof verification).\"},\"verifyStatementProof(bytes32,bytes,bytes)\":{\"notice\":\"Verify that the SP1 proof is valid AND the public values contain         the expected statement root.\"}},\"notice\":\"Binds the realized-allocation-statement.v1 SP1 program to the         EVM verification gateway and performs structural validation of the         guest's UTF-8 JSON public values.         Two duties:         1. Pins the SP1 program verification key for the            `realized-statement-sp1-program.v1` guest and delegates            cryptographic proof verification to an `ISP1Verifier`            (canonical SP1 Groth16 verifier, or MockSP1Verifier for tests).         2. Extracts the `statement-root` from the guest's UTF-8 JSON            public values and verifies structural fields: `result/status`            must be \\\"passing\\\" and `schema-version` must be            \\\"realized-allocation-statement.v1\\\".\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/PrfRealizedAllocationVerifierAdapter.sol\":\"PrfRealizedAllocationVerifierAdapter\"},\"evmVersion\":\"prague\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@openzeppelin/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\",\":ds-test/=lib/forge-std/lib/ds-test/src/\",\":erc4626-tests/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/lib/erc4626-tests/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":halmos-cheatcodes/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/lib/halmos-cheatcodes/src/\",\":openzeppelin-contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\"]},\"sources\":{\"src/ISP1Verifier.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x546a397653cecbe54ccbc4cb85bcc8a57bdc974d2fec644b5a5dce62075110b6\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://40d